    "response_text": "[{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"**Analyzing the Addition**\\n\\nI'm currently focused on `FUN_00102163`, specifically the `ADD qword ptr [RDX + 0x5e], 0x17` instruction. My immediate concern is understanding the effective address `RDX + 0x5e`. Tracing back, I see `RDX` is initially set to `0`, then decremented by `0x5e`. It's subsequently added to `RSI`, which holds `RSP`. This sequence is key to resolving the operand's location.\\n\\n\",\"thought\":true}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"responseId\":\"Td0Ea7ajDs6m9LsPt_LcgQs\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.1-pro-preview\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"**Adjusting Return Path**\\n\\nI've determined that `RDX` effectively resolves to `RSP`, so `FUN_00102163` is directly modifying the return address on the stack. This means the intended execution flow is being rerouted to `001011c5`, effectively skipping a block of code and potentially corrupting subsequent analysis.\\n\\n\",\"thought\":true}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"responseId\":\"Td0Ea7ajDs6m9LsPt_LcgQs\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.1-pro-preview\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"**Zeroing Local Variables**\\n\\nI've pinpointed two local variable initializations to zero within `FUN_00102163`, occurring at `[RBP-0x14]` and `[RBP-0x18]`. The execution flow then proceeds to modify the return address, as previously observed.\\n\\n\",\"thought\":true}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"responseId\":\"Td0Ea7ajDs6m9LsPt_LcgQs\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.1-pro-preview\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"functionCall\":{\"name\":\"mcp_ghidra_disassemble_function\",\"args\":{\"address\":\"00101140\",\"offset\":86,\"limit\":500},\"id\":\"mcp_ghidra_disassemble_function__call_13534431302635661423\"},\"thoughtSignature\":\"\"}]}}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\"},\"responseId\":\"Td0Ea7ajDs6m9LsPt_LcgQs\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.1-pro-preview\"},{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"\"}]},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\"}],\"usageMetadata\":{\"promptTokenCount\":26301,\"candidatesTokenCount\":42,\"totalTokenCount\":28007,\"trafficType\":\"ON_DEMAND\",\"promptTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":26301}],\"candidatesTokensDetails\":[{\"modality\":\"TEXT\",\"tokenCount\":42}],\"thoughtsTokenCount\":1664},\"responseId\":\"Td0Ea7ajDs6m9LsPt_LcgQs\",\"modelVersion\":\"gemini-3.1-pro-preview\"}]",
